{"id":"vod_sn_38800","vodId":"38800","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"牙狼Garo","name_cn":"牙狼Garo","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a6bb572e5a6a0d8d2ece0beb970f1c20.jpg"},"summary":"从古至今，人们惧怕黑暗。因为在人们心中，潜藏著名为“阴我”的负面意念，导致魔兽“骇魔”（Horror）得以利用入侵附身。而人类当中有一群人，手持钢铁利剑，一子单传，秘密守护人类不受“骇魔”侵略，他们被称之为“魔戒骑士”，生于黑暗，也隐于黑暗，世代与“骇魔”进行无止境的战争…　　立志成为画家的御月薰，即将举行她首次的个展。但她却也梦见了童年时父亲所画的“黄金骑士”绘本，让她非常在意。虽然与心理咨询师龙崎驱音谈过之后，薰总算能安心迎接个展，但画廊老板却突然化为了异形怪物向她袭击。这时，在薰眼前出现了一名身穿白色大衣的神秘青年，并变身打倒了怪物。而他变身后的模样，正巧与绘本中所画的“黄金骑士”如出一辙……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vjyYg4qqZ31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/L1i6Lu3JTu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hyFEabN3i31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E9Q7C1JiWv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/RkkaVxUQZX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zWAjFFatEX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PerJuf7MeS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Rz2jKWHGmT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0jKqabzVmn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XvppERcaGs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tiFcchmun21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hsfFhHu42c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7hBk1Sj9QU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DnHphYCCCb1/video/index.m3